Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 03:15:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1169/1179] HERESY 1167: the style meter's token estimate by
 script, measured with YuE2's own BPE
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor, 05.10.2026, of a 15-minute reading: «По токенам музыкальным красное». The estimate counted every non-ASCII
character as a token.

Measured 06.10.2026 with YuE2's BPE (Qwen2's merges, through Qwen2.5-Omni's tokenizer.json), on the studio's own texts.
It agrees with the engine's log: the Heretic lyrics 842 + its style 29 + 22 markers = the logged prefix of 893.

How far off the old estimate was:
· Russian: 1.7–2.1 times too long;
· Ukrainian and Belarusian: 1.5–1.6;
· Hebrew: 2.1;
· Greek, English, Spanish, Italian: about right.

Now:
· ASCII: 3.6 characters a token;
· Cyrillic: 0.5 tokens a letter (lyrics run dearer than prose: 0.53 on the Heretic, 0.42 on the guide);
· Cyrillic with Ukrainian or Belarusian letters: 0.6;
· Greek: 1;
· Hebrew: 0.45;
· anything else: 1, as before.

The Heretic lyrics now estimate at 826 against a real 842 tokens (−2 %), where the old estimate said 1,405.

cdp-console 340/0/7 (the rates checked), check-i18n 14/0, check-player 3/0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/console/help.js | 20 ++++++++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 16 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/console/help.js b/tools/console/help.js
index f9ac58c..9b344dd 100644
--- a/tools/console/help.js
+++ b/tools/console/help.js
@@ -347,13 +347,25 @@
   }
   function mmss(s) { s = Math.max(0, Math.round(s)); return Math.floor(s / 60) + ":" + ("0" + s % 60).slice(-2); }
 
-  // An estimate without the tokenizer: English runs about 3.6 characters a token, other scripts ~1
+  // An estimate without the tokenizer: English runs about 3.6 characters a token.
+  // HERESY 1167: the other scripts measured with YuE2's own BPE on the studio's texts (06.10.2026); the old «~1 a
+  // character» made Russian 1.7–2.1 times too long, Ukrainian and Belarusian 1.5–1.6, Hebrew 2.1:
+  // · Cyrillic: 0.5 tokens a letter (lyrics run dearer than prose), 0.6 when Ukrainian or Belarusian letters show;
+  // · Greek: 1;
+  // · Hebrew: 0.45;
+  // · anything else (accents, marks, other scripts): 1, as before.
+  var UKBE = /[іїєґўІЇЄҐЎ]/;
   function estimateTokens(text) {
-    var ascii = 0, other = 0;
+    var ascii = 0, cyr = 0, greek = 0, hebrew = 0, other = 0;
     for (var i = 0; i < text.length; i++) {
-      if (text.charCodeAt(i) < 128) ascii++; else other++;
+      var c = text.charCodeAt(i);
+      if (c < 128) ascii++;
+      else if (c >= 0x400 && c <= 0x4ff) cyr++;
+      else if ((c >= 0x370 && c <= 0x3ff) || (c >= 0x1f00 && c <= 0x1fff)) greek++;
+      else if (c >= 0x590 && c <= 0x5ff) hebrew++;
+      else other++;
     }
-    return Math.ceil(ascii / 3.6 + other);
+    return Math.ceil(ascii / 3.6 + cyr * (UKBE.test(text) ? 0.6 : 0.5) + greek + hebrew * 0.45 + other);
   }
 
